  "description": "What’s better than a good meal? My name’s Jae-Ho and I love food. While some may call me a deadbEAT because I don’t have a job at the moment, I’m just your normal happy guy who loves eating and my girlfriend of 7 years. That is until I got a breakup text yesterday. Where did things go wrong? I keep trying to look back through the years, but I just can't figure it out... \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
